{"id": "g11-031", "domain": "restaurant", "names": ["Waiter1", "Waiter2", "Chef", "Menu"], "groups": {}, "text": "Restaurant. Put Waiter1 and Waiter2 in a group, then call that group Floor. Chef alone. Menu below Floor. Is Chef in any group? Make Floor teal.", "wires": [{"span": "Put Waiter1 and Waiter2 in a group, then call that group Floor", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Waiter1,Waiter2", "name": "Floor"}}, {"span": "Menu below Floor", "trigger": "below", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Menu", "position": "below", "anchor": "Floor"}}, {"span": "Is Chef in any group", "trigger": "in any group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Chef"}}, {"span": "Make Floor teal", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Floor", "color": "teal"}}]}
