{"id": "g11-038", "domain": "water cycle", "names": ["Sea", "Cloud", "Rain", "River"], "groups": {}, "text": "Water cycle poster. Put Cloud and Rain together as Sky, Sea and River as Ground. Move Sky to the top and Ground to the bottom. Turn Cloud into an ellipse. Which group is Sea in?", "wires": [{"span": "Put Cloud and Rain together as Sky", "trigger": "together", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Cloud,Rain", "name": "Sky"}}, {"span": "Sea and River as Ground", "trigger": "as", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Sea,River", "name": "Ground"}}, {"span": "Move Sky to the top", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Sky", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Ground to the bottom", "trigger": "to the bottom", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Ground", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Turn Cloud into an ellipse", "trigger": "Turn", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cloud", "shape": "ellipse"}}, {"span": "Which group is Sea in", "trigger": "Which group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Sea"}}]}
{"id": "g11-039", "domain": "office floor", "names": ["Desk1", "Desk2", "Desk3", "Desk4", "Printer", "Plant", "Door"], "groups": {}, "text": "Office floor plan, second attempt, ignore the first one. The four desks should be pairs: Desk1 and Desk2 as PairA, Desk3 and Desk4 as PairB. Printer and Plant go together as Extras. Door at the bottom. PairA left of PairB. Extras above PairA. Make Extras small. Turn Plant into a green star. Which groups do we have, and what's in Extras?", "wires": [{"span": "Desk1 and Desk2 as PairA", "trigger": "as", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Desk1,Desk2", "name": "PairA"}}, {"span": "Desk3 and Desk4 as PairB", "trigger": "as", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Desk3,Desk4", "name": "PairB"}}, {"span": "Printer and Plant go together as Extras", "trigger": "together", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Printer,Plant", "name": "Extras"}}, {"span": "Door at the bottom", "trigger": "at the bottom", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Door", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "PairA left of PairB", "trigger": "left of", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "PairA", "position": "leftOf", "anchor": "PairB"}}, {"span": "Extras above PairA", "trigger": "above", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Extras", "position": "above", "anchor": "PairA"}}, {"span": "Make Extras small", "trigger": "small", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Extras", "size": "small"}}, {"span": "Turn Plant into a green star", "trigger": "Turn", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Plant", "shape": "star", "color": "green"}}, {"span": "Which groups do we have", "trigger": "Which groups", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "kind": "group"}}, {"span": "what's in Extras", "trigger": "what's in", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "members", "target": "Extras"}}]}
